OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 13, stabbed in third Arndale
OL,4,Aattack in a fortnight
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage boy has been seriously
OL,7,Finjured in a third incident involving a
OL,8,Fknife at Manchester's Arndale centre
OL,9,Fwithin a fortnight.
OL,11,FOfficers from Greater Manchester Police
OL,12,F(GMP) were called to Market Street at
OL,13,F19:00 GMT on Tuesday.
OL,15,FA GMP spokesperson said a 13-year-old
OL,16,Fboy was found and taken to hospital
OL,17,Fwith potentially life-changing
OL,18,Finjuries, while two boys, aged 14 and
OL,19,F16, were arrested on suspicion of
OL,20,Faffray.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
