OL,4,Aattack in a fortnight
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 14-year-old boy was stabbed at
OL,7,FManchester's Arndale shopping centre on
OL,8,FSaturday, 17 October, and was taken to
OL,9,Fhospital with injuries consistent with
OL,10,Fa stab wound, while two other
OL,11,F14-year-old boys were arrested.
